  "openQuestions": [
    "The 수납완료 column accepts a drop from 대기 when the card has 수납존재여부, but handleDrop has no 대기 branch, so nothing happens (see 'drag 대기 -> 수납완료 (수납존재여부=true)'). Apparent bug.",
    "Drag 수납 -> 수납완료 without an existing receipt opens the checkout panel instead of changing status; 치료 -> 수납완료 without a receipt is rejected; 대기 -> 수납완료 is never possible. The redesigned machine allows WAITING/IN_TREATMENT -> CHECKOUT (COMPLETED) directly.",
    "The client lets 수납완료 move back to 대기, 치료 and 수납 freely (no check that a receipt exists or must be voided). The redesign only allows COMPLETED -> REOPEN (AWAITING_PAYMENT) and CANCEL.",
